DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ffeeggeettrroouunndd() function determines the current floating-point rounding
     mode, and the ffeesseettrroouunndd() function sets the current rounding mode to
     _r_o_u_n_d.  The rounding mode is one of FE_TONEAREST, FE_DOWNWARD, FE_UPWARD,
     or FE_TOWARDZERO, as described in fenv(3).

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     The ffeeggeettrroouunndd() routine returns the current rounding mode.  The
     ffeesseettrroouunndd() function returns 0 on success and non-zero otherwise; how‐
     ever, the present implementation always succeeds.

